<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian inflation 0.1 pct mo/mo in March.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian inflation 0.1 pct mo/mo in March.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Lithuania was running at 0.1 percent on a month-on-month basis in March, the statistics department said on Monday.</p>
<p>The department did not provide year-on-year figures for last month as at the start of the year it changed the way it calculates the index and is still in the process of revising the figures for last year according to the new calculation method.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN INFLATION	 March '97   Feb '97  March '96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)  +0.1	   +0.6	+2.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	    N/A	    N/A	 31.6</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
</text>
